            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Inventory for 1 MJ heat from wood chips, burned in a cogeneration unit with a capacity of 300 kWth. The multioutput process "wood chips, burned in cogen 300kWth delivers the coproducts "heat, at cogen 300kWth, wood chips, allocation exergy" and "electricity, at cogen 300kWth, wood chips, allocation exergy". The energy efficiency is 30% for electricity and 54% for heat. The economic factor is 0.77 for electricity and 0.23 for heat. This leads to the allocation factor of 0.65 for electricity and 0.35 for heat.</common:generalComment>
